---
import AgentJourney from "../components/AgentJourney.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title="CMS for AI Agents"
	description="Build an EmDash site with a coding agent, then let authorized AI agents work with content through your site's MCP server. Keep drafts, roles, and editorial review in one CMS."
>
	<section class="agent-hero">
		<div class="page-container">
			<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
				<a href="/">EmDash</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>For agents</span>
			</nav>
			<div class="hero-grid">
				<div class="hero-copy">
					<p class="eyebrow">A CMS for humans and agents</p>
					<h1>Let agents work. Keep the content yours.</h1>
					<p class="hero-lead">
						Build a site with your coding agent. Then connect an authorized agent to your site’s content.
						EmDash gives it tools for the content and schema you permit while your team keeps the editor, drafts, and publishing controls.
					</p>
					<div class="hero-actions">
						<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/guides/ai-tools/">Connect an agent <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
						<a class="text-link" href="#two-paths">See the two paths <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<AgentJourney />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="paths-section" id="two-paths" aria-labelledby="paths-heading">
		<div class="page-container">
			<header class="section-intro">
				<p class="eyebrow">Start with the right connection</p>
				<h2 id="paths-heading">Two jobs. Two starting points.</h2>
				<p>An agent building the site needs the EmDash guide. An agent working with your site’s content needs its authenticated MCP server. They are different connections for different work.</p>
			</header>
			<div class="path-grid">
				<article class="path-card path-card--build">
					<span class="path-label"><span class="path-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{`{ }`}</span> BUILD THE SITE</span>
					<h3>Give your coding agent the brief.</h3>
					<p>Start with the project you have. The agent reads EmDash’s site-building guide, models editable content, and runs a local Astro page you can review.</p>
					<div class="prompt-art" aria-hidden="true">
						<div class="prompt-top"><span class="prompt-spark">✳</span> Your coding agent <span class="prompt-caret">›</span></div>
						<div class="prompt-body">Read <em>emdashcms.com/start.md</em>, inspect my project, and build an editable site I can preview locally.</div>
						<div class="prompt-footer"><span class="prompt-pulse"></span> site brief → schema → Astro page</div>
					</div>
					<a class="card-link" href="/start.md">Read the site-building guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
				<article class="path-card path-card--operate">
					<span class="path-label"><span class="path-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span> WORK WITH CONTENT</span>
					<h3>Connect to the site you run.</h3>
					<p>Your EmDash site exposes an MCP endpoint. Sign in with OAuth or an access token, choose permissions, then ask the agent to read, draft, edit, or publish within those limits.</p>
					<div class="connection-art" aria-hidden="true">
						<div class="connection-line"><span class="connection-icon">◎</span><span>Agent client</span><span class="connection-rule"></span><span class="connection-icon connection-icon--end">▤</span><span>EmDash site</span></div>
						<div class="endpoint">https://your-site.example/<strong>_emdash/api/mcp</strong></div>
						<div class="scopes"><span>content:read</span><span>content:write</span><span>schema:read</span><span class="scope-role">Bound by role</span></div>
					</div>
					<a class="card-link" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/guides/ai-tools/">Set up your site’s MCP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="workflow-section" aria-labelledby="workflow-heading">
		<div class="page-container workflow-grid">
			<div class="workflow-copy">
				<p class="eyebrow">Editorial work, not a black box</p>
				<h2 id="workflow-heading">A draft you can actually inspect.</h2>
				<p>Ask an agent to read the collection schema, create a draft, and compare it with the live version. Review in the EmDash admin, then publish yourself—or let an authorized agent publish when you choose.</p>
				<a class="text-link" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/guides/ai-tools/">Explore the agent workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
			</div>
			<ol class="workflow-steps">
				<li><span>01</span><div><strong>Know the model</strong><p>Read the permitted collection schema before writing content.</p></div></li>
				<li><span>02</span><div><strong>Work in a draft</strong><p>Create or edit without changing the published page yet.</p></div></li>
				<li><span>03</span><div><strong>Compare, then decide</strong><p>Review live versus draft before anyone publishes.</p></div></li>
			</ol>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="permission-section" aria-labelledby="permission-heading">
		<div class="page-container">
			<header class="permission-intro">
				<p class="eyebrow">Permission is part of the product</p>
				<h2 id="permission-heading">Give an agent a role, not a blank check.</h2>
				<p>OAuth consent lets you remove permissions a client doesn’t need. Each tool call still has to satisfy both the token’s scope and the person’s EmDash role.</p>
			</header>
			<div class="permission-bento">
					<div class="scope-card" aria-hidden="true">
					<div class="scope-head"><span class="scope-emblem">✳</span><div><strong>Connect an agent</strong><span>Choose the work it can do</span></div><span class="scope-more">•••</span></div>
					<div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-check">✓</span><div><strong>Read content</strong><small>Explore posts and pages</small></div><code>content:read</code></div>
					<div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-check">✓</span><div><strong>Write content</strong><small>Create and update drafts</small></div><code>content:write</code></div>
					<div class="scope-row"><span class="scope-check">✓</span><div><strong>Read schema</strong><small>Understand available fields</small></div><code>schema:read</code></div>
					<div class="scope-row scope-row--off"><span class="scope-check"></span><div><strong>Change schema</strong><small>Not needed for this job</small></div><code>schema:write</code></div>
					<div class="scope-note"><span>↳</span> Your role sets the upper limit.</div>
				</div>
				<div class="permission-aside">
					<div class="aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">◎</div>
					<h3>People and agents share the same rules.</h3>
					<p>A Contributor can draft but cannot publish. An Author can publish owned content. EmDash enforces role and token permissions at the API boundary, not in a prompt.</p>
					<a class="text-link" href="https://docs.emdashcms.com/reference/mcp-server/">Read the MCP reference <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="agent-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
		<div class="page-container faq-grid">
			<div><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 id="faq-heading">The practical bits.</h2></div>
			<div class="faq-list">
				<details><summary>Is the docs MCP the same as my site’s MCP?</summary><p>No. The EmDash documentation helps a coding agent understand how to build a site. Your own site’s authenticated MCP endpoint lets an agent work with that site’s content.</p></details>
				<details><summary>Does connecting an agent bypass user roles?</summary><p>No. The token needs the relevant scope and the signed-in person needs the relevant role. EmDash rejects calls that lack either permission.</p></details>
				<details><summary>Can I review an agent’s changes before publishing?</summary><p>Yes. Ask it to create a draft and compare the live and draft versions in EmDash. Review is a workflow you choose, not a promise that every action requires approval.</p></details>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="agent-cta"><div class="page-container"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start with a brief</p><h2>Give the agent context. Keep the work visible.</h2></div><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/start.md">Read the starter guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>

<style>
	.page-container { width: min(calc(100% - 3rem), var(--wide-width)); margin-inline: auto; }
	.eyebrow { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.05em; text-wrap: balance; }
	h2 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.7vw, 4.7rem); line-height: 1.07; }
	.agent-hero { padding: 8.5rem 0 clamp(5rem, 8vw, 8rem); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 68%, var(--color-surface)); }
	.breadcrumbs { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.78rem; }
	.breadcrumbs a { color: inherit; }
	.breadcrumbs a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
	.hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem); margin-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
	.hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
	h1 { max-width: 36rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 5vw, 5.2rem); line-height: 1.02; }
	.hero-lead { max-width: 34rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.3vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.65; }
	.hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.65rem; margin-top: 2.1rem; }
	.hero-actions .btn, .agent-cta .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.7rem; }
	.text-link, .card-link { display: inline-flex; width: fit-content; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
	.text-link:hover, .card-link:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }
	.text-link:focus-visible, .card-link:focus-visible, .breadcrumbs a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); outline-offset: 5px; border-radius: 2px; }
	.paths-section, .agent-faq { padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0; }
	#two-paths { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
	.section-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.72fr); align-items: end; gap: 1rem 4rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
	.section-intro .eyebrow { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
	.section-intro h2 { max-width: 40rem; }
	.section-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 30rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.path-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
	.path-card { display: flex; min-width: 0; min-height: 35rem; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); overflow: hidden; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
	.path-card--operate { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 58%, var(--color-surface)); }
	.path-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
	.path-symbol { display: grid; width: 1.7rem; height: 1.7rem; place-items: center; background: var(--heat-8); border: 1px solid var(--heat-12); border-radius: 0.42rem; font-size: 0.88rem; }
	h3 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.65rem); line-height: 1.12; }
	.path-card h3 { max-width: 23rem; margin: 1.6rem 0 0.75rem; }
	.path-card > p { max-width: 28rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.94rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.prompt-art, .connection-art { width: 100%; min-width: 0; margin: auto 0 1.7rem; padding: 1.1rem; overflow: hidden; background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.7rem; box-shadow: 0 14px 35px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 5%, transparent); }
	.prompt-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; }
	.prompt-spark { color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.prompt-caret { margin-inline-start: auto; color: var(--color-muted); }
	.prompt-body { padding: 1.3rem 0; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; }
	.prompt-body em { color: var(--color-primary); font-style: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.prompt-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.62rem; }
	.prompt-pulse { width: 0.42rem; height: 0.42rem; background: var(--color-primary); border-radius: 50%; }
	.connection-line { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
	.connection-icon { display: grid; width: 1.55rem; height: 1.55rem; flex: none; place-items: center; color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--heat-8); border-radius: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
	.connection-rule { min-width: 0.65rem; flex: 1; border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-primary); }
	.endpoint { margin: 1.2rem 0; padding: 0.8rem; color: var(--color-muted); background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 0.4rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.endpoint strong { color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }
	.scopes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
	.scopes span { padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--heat-8); border: 1px solid var(--heat-12); border-radius: 0.3rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.58rem; }
	.scopes .scope-role { margin-inline-start: auto; color: var(--color-muted); background: var(--color-surface); border-color: var(--color-border); }
	.card-link { margin-top: 0; }
	.workflow-section { padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 55%, var(--color-surface)); border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.workflow-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr); gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem); }
	.workflow-copy h2 { max-width: 31rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
	.workflow-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 33rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.workflow-copy .text-link { margin-top: 2rem; }
	.workflow-steps { list-style: none; }
	.workflow-steps li { display: flex; gap: 1.6rem; padding: 1.35rem 0 1.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.workflow-steps li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.workflow-steps li > span { color: var(--color-primary); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; }
	.workflow-steps strong { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
	.workflow-steps p { max-width: 25rem; margin-top: 0.45rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.55; }
	.permission-section { padding: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0; }
	.permission-intro { max-width: 49rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
	.permission-intro h2 { margin: 1rem 0; }
	.permission-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 39rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.permission-bento { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
	.scope-card, .permission-aside { min-width: 0; min-height: 27rem; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
	.scope-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 90%, var(--heat-12), transparent 50%), var(--color-surface); }
	.scope-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.scope-emblem { display: grid; width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; flex: none; place-items: center; color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--heat-8); border-radius: 0.6rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
	.scope-head div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.2rem; }
	.scope-head strong, .scope-row strong { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
	.scope-head div span, .scope-row small { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.68rem; }
	.scope-more { margin-inline-start: auto; color: var(--color-muted); }
	.scope-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; padding: 0.85rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.scope-row > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.24rem; }
	.scope-check { display: grid; width: 1.05rem; height: 1.05rem; flex: none; place-items: center; color: var(--button-primary-fg); background: var(--color-primary); border: 1px solid var(--color-primary); border-radius: 0.27rem; font-size: 0.7rem; }
	.scope-row--off .scope-check { background: transparent; border-color: var(--color-border); }
	.scope-row code { margin-inline-start: auto; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.61rem; white-space: nowrap; }
	.scope-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.1rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; }
	.scope-note span { color: var(--color-primary); }
	.permission-aside { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
	.aside-mark { display: grid; width: 2.1rem; height: 2.1rem; place-items: center; color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--heat-8); border-radius: 0.6rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.permission-aside h3 { max-width: 20rem; margin: 1.8rem 0 0.7rem; font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.7vw, 2.35rem); }
	.permission-aside p { max-width: 25rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.permission-aside .text-link { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 2rem; }
	.faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); gap: 3rem; }
	.faq-grid h2 { margin-top: 1rem; }
	.faq-list details { padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.faq-list details:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.faq-list summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; list-style: none; }
	.faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
	.faq-list summary::after { float: right; margin-inline-start: 1rem; color: var(--color-primary); content: "+"; }
	.faq-list details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
	.faq-list summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); outline-offset: 5px; }
	.faq-list details p { max-width: 38rem; padding-top: 1rem; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
	.agent-cta { padding: 4rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
	.agent-cta .page-container { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; }
	.agent-cta h2 { max-width: 42rem; margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem); }
	.agent-cta .btn { flex: none; }
	@media (max-width: 950px) {
		.hero-grid, .section-intro, .workflow-grid, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.hero-copy { max-width: 44rem; }
		.section-intro .eyebrow { grid-column: auto; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.page-container { width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--wide-width)); }
		.agent-hero { padding-top: 7rem; }
		.path-grid, .permission-bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.path-card { min-height: 32rem; }
		.agent-cta .page-container { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
	}
	@media (max-width: 400px) {
		.connection-line { font-size: 0.62rem; }
		.scope-row code { font-size: 0.55rem; }
	}
</style>
